e, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":191653,"global_rank":349785},{"name":"cptavatar/cz-parser","owner":"cptavatar","html_url":"https://github.com/cptavatar/cz-parser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"Just some clojure JSON parsing code to help do a bit more filtering out of vendor files I needed to look at. ","topics":[],"score":191653,"global_rank":349786},{"name":"amontes261/amontes261","owner":"amontes261","html_url":"https://github.com/amontes261/amontes261","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Just here for the README :)","topics":[],"score":191650,"global_rank":349789},{"name":"peeyush1234/reek.tmbundle","owner":"peeyush1234","html_url":"https://github.com/peeyush1234/reek.tmbundle","stars":2,"forks":2,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Reek Textmate Bundle","topics":[],"score":191646,"global_rank":349790},{"name":"leakingtapan/reactive-design-patterns","owner":"leakingtapan","html_url":"https://github.com/leakingtapan/reactive-design-patterns","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Scala","description":"Sample Code for reactive design patterns book","topics":[],"score":191645,"global_rank":349791},{"name":"StephRoark/ExData_Plotting2","owner":"StephRoark","html_url":"https://github.com/StephRoark/ExData_Plotting2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":191645,"global_rank":349798},{"name":"wormeyman/EatingRichlyYouTubeEmbed","owner":"wormeyman","html_url":"https://github.com/wormeyman/EatingRichlyYouTubeEmbed","sta